      "id": 233682,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-09-01T16:30:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, hold the phone.</p>\n<p>HOLY CRAP PAUL</p>\n<p>HOW LONG HAVE YOU BEEN HIDING THIS MELLIFLUOUS SINGING VOICE FROM US?</p>\n<p>Petition for Paul to produce an album of a capella 19th century drinking songs. He is clearly an accomplished folk singer and I want more!</p>\n<p>Now back to your regularly-scheduled stream-of-consciousness reaction notes.</p>\n<p>Trevor is the hero we need. :D</p>\n<p>I love the crossed-out \"Sentinels Comics Lore\" topic under questions. That will never get old. XD</p>\n<p>Never thought I'd hear Zaboomafoo referenced on the Letters Page. &gt;.&gt;</p>\n<p>And I like Paul's assessment of that one question as \"the Andiest question ever\".</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:09:34.584Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
