      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Okay, hold the phone.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>HOLY CRAP PAUL</p>\r\n\r\n<p>HOW LONG HAVE YOU BEEN HIDING THIS MELLIFLUOUS SINGING VOICE FROM US?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Petition for Paul to produce an album of a capella 19th century drinking songs. He is clearly an accomplished folk singer and I want more!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now back to your regularly-scheduled stream-of-consciousness reaction notes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Trevor is the hero we need. :D</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I love the crossed-out \"Sentinels Comics Lore\" topic under questions. That will never get old. XD</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Never thought I'd hear Zaboomafoo referenced on the Letters Page. &gt;.&gt;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And I like Paul's assessment of that one question as \"the Andiest question ever\".</p>",
