      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I would certainly be happy if Spirit Island was done, given the sheer size and number of gameplay options of the game at this point, but it’s also exciting to hear that it’s got some more content plotted out ahead of it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, I’ve been debating if I want to get any additional expansions. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I love the game, but it doesn’t hit the table enough to feel like I’ve played the current spirits much, let alone adding even more choices! :-\\</p>",
