      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Whatever the next expansion is I’m kind of hoping for more less complex spirits as Jagged Earth had no easy ones.   Which means if you are introducing the game to six new players you don’t have have an easy complexity option for them all.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Agreed! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>(I know Powerhound already saw it, but for everyone else: This was shared with Eric in the playtester discord. We’ll see what he says…)</p>",
